id: junior-creation
name: Junior Creation
type: standard
actionCost: 1
actionCostMax: 3
kiCostPerBaseTier: 4
kiPerAction: true
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# Junior Creation (2)'s, open while it applies: 4(bT) Ki for each of its 1-3 Actions (use-maneuver.mjs kiPerAction).
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Duplicate Minion beside you for each Action spent, of a Small base Size Category.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Maneuver with a Variable Action Cost (1~3 Actions) and a Variable Ki Cost (4(bT) for each Action spent), create a Duplicate Minion on a square adjacent to you for each Action spent on this Maneuver. This Minion's base Size Category is Small, or, if your base Size Category is Small or less – then that Minion's Size Category is 1 Size Category smaller than yours.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1~3 Actions
  –KP Cost: 4(bT) for each Action spent
  –Effect: A Duplicate Minion for each Action spent.

---

[on used]
smallDuplicates();
